        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the moving service insured and what does the insurance cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. The policy protects against loss, theft, accidental damage, and natural hazards from the point of loading in Hebbal to delivery in Vellore. Claims are processed quickly, with full documentation provided by our support team.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I track my shipment in real time on the Bangalore to Vellore route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All our container trucks are equipped with GPS devices linked to a satellite‑based tracking portal. Customers receive a unique tracking ID and can view live location, estimated arrival time, and checkpoint status on a mobile‑friendly dashboard. Real‑time alerts are also sent via SMS or email.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers a verified packer in Bangalore?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We are accredited by the Indian Banks Association (IBA) mover code, hold ISO 9001:2015 certification, and have completed over 22,000 relocations with a 4.9/5 Google rating. Our fleet of 120+ specialized trucks, trained staff, and compliance with GST and e‑Way bill regulations further validate our credibility.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the typical Bangalore to Vellore relocation take and what factors affect it?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average transit time is 12‑14 hours, depending on traffic density, weather conditions, and checkpoint clearances along NH 48 and NH 46. Night‑time moves, pre‑planned route optimization, and real‑time tracking help minimize delays, ensuring your household goods reach Vellore as scheduled.</p>
